  "description": {
    "en": "Kirschbaum Flash is a soft textured co-polymix string developed from the Pro Line family material platform. It is engineered to deliver maximum power and exceptional comfort while maintaining strong control and enhanced spin through its textured surface. Available in several vibrant colors, Flash is designed for players who want a softer, more dynamic polyester response without sacrificing ball grip or directional accuracy. The 1.25 mm version emphasizes power, spin and feel, while the 1.30 mm version offers greater durability and stability.",

    "zh": "Kirschbaum Flash 是一款基于 Pro Line 系列材料平台开发的柔和型纹理共聚酯球线，核心特点是高力量输出、优秀舒适性以及良好的旋转和控制表现。特殊纹理表面能够增强咬球和旋转，同时整体配方比传统硬质聚酯更加柔和、活跃。Flash 还提供黄色、绿色、粉色、黑色、橙色和青绿色等多种鲜艳颜色。1.25毫米版本更强调力量、旋转与手感；1.30毫米版本则更偏向耐久和稳定。"
  },

